                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-8" aria-label="Return from footnote 8.">Return to 8</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-9">Data in this paragraph are derived from the Federal Reserve&rsquo;s&nbsp;<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="http://www.federalreserve.gov/releases/z1/" class="offsite" target="_blank">Financial Accounts of the United States</a>&nbsp;(Flow of Funds Accounts).
