                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-10">For a discussion of Reg Q, see R. Alton Gilbert,&nbsp;<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://research.stlouisfed.org/publications/review/86/02/Requiem_Feb1986.pdf" class="offsite" target="_blank">&ldquo;Requiem for Regulation Q: What It Did and Why It Passed Away,&rdquo;</a> <em>Review</em>, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis, February 1986, pp. 22-37.
